Bakery Website Development Requirements

Project Overview

We are developing a premium Western bakery website with a modern, elegant, and minimal design. The overall theme should use off-white and brown colors to create a luxurious bakery experience. I will provide the logo, design references, Cloudinary credentials, MongoDB credentials, and other required assets.

⸻

Design & UI

* Build a premium, modern, and responsive website.
* Follow the reference website as closely as possible in terms of:
    * Homepage layout
    * Loading screen
    * Animations
    * Overall premium feel
* Use an off-white + brown color palette.
* Maintain consistent typography, spacing, and smooth transitions.
* Ensure excellent mobile, tablet, and desktop responsiveness.

⸻

Backend (Admin Panel)

The admin panel should allow complete management of products.

Each product should include:

* Product Name
* Category
* Price
* Product Image (uploaded to Cloudinary)

Category Management

The admin should be able to:

* Create categories
* Edit categories
* Delete categories
* Assign a category while creating a product

Example categories:

* Cakes
* Birthday Cakes
* Wedding Cakes
* Pastries
* Breads
* Cookies
* Shawarma
* Biryani
* Snacks
* Beverages

⸻

Product Management

Admin features:

* Add Product
* Edit Product
* Delete Product
* Upload images to Cloudinary
* Store image URLs in MongoDB
* Display products dynamically on the frontend

⸻

Homepage

The homepage should include:

* Premium hero section
* Loading animation
* Featured bakery products
* Shawarma section
* Biryani section
* Popular products
* About Bakery
* Why Choose Us
* Customer Reviews
* Gallery
* Contact section
* Beautiful footer

⸻

Cake Collection Page

Create a dedicated cake collection section.

Instead of a large button, display elegant text such as:

“View All Cake Collections →”

This should navigate users to the complete cake collection page.

All cake products will be managed dynamically from the admin panel.

⸻

Database

Use MongoDB.

I will provide:

* MongoDB connection string
* Database credentials

⸻

Image Storage

Use Cloudinary for all product images.

I will provide:

* Cloudinary Cloud Name
* API Key
* API Secret

Images should be uploaded directly to Cloudinary, and only the image URL should be stored in MongoDB.

⸻

Technology Stack

* React.js (Frontend)
* Node.js
* Express.js
* MongoDB
* Cloudinary
* Tailwind CSS (preferred) or another modern styling framework

⸻

Additional Requirements

* Premium animations
* Fast loading
* Responsive design
* Clean code structure
* Dynamic content throughout
* Easy-to-manage admin dashboard
* Modern UI/UX following the provided reference

Once I share the logo, reference website, Cloudinary credentials, and MongoDB credentials, the project should be implemented according to these requirements while maintaining a premium Western bakery aesthetic.

